Hand-written revert of d4965643 against the current tree: a won output claim opens its
freshness gate while outputsMu is still held (claimOutput, and claimAll for an Exec), and an
Exec claim opens each gate as it wins it. A gate call takes graph.mu and its unlock can deliver
record listeners that take the run's lock, so the gate must open only after outputsMu is released.
Later edits (producerKind) keep the commit's own hunks from reversing.

